:WqJUjSmGAqAAZha3 a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description """Outflow/Transfer events occur either due to unexpected outflow events arising from environmental or market conditions or 
when an Obligation to Exchange triggers Obligation Fulfillment event. 
Transfer may involve Provision of Services or Assumption of Claims (Transfer of Rights enabling Other Party to Transfer Claims). 
Outflows/Transfers ontologically always result in Decreases in Equity (Expenses) typically accompanied by Decreases in Assets or Increases in Liabilities.""" ;
    ontouml:isAbstract false ;
    ontouml:isDerived false ;
    ontouml:isPowertype false ;
    ontouml:name "Transfer Recognition"@en ;
    ontouml:order "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    ontouml:project :gLGH3HGGAqAAahF6 ;
    ontouml:restrictedTo ontouml:eventNature ;
    ontouml:stereotype ontouml:event .

:YGtOsSmGAqAAZyve a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description """An Economic Exchange is a reciprocal transaction between market participants that entails the transfer of economic resources.
In return, each participant becomes entitled to commensurate economic benefits, with the entire exchange conducted under the going concern objective.

Exchange
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rational_economic_exchange""" ;
    ontouml:isAbstract false ;
    ontouml:isDerived false ;
    ontouml:isPowertype false ;
    ontouml:name "Exchange Type"@en ;
    ontouml:order "2"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    ontouml:project :gLGH3HGGAqAAahF6 ;
    ontouml:restrictedTo ontouml:typeNature ;
    ontouml:stereotype ontouml:type .

